Write a first chapter of comedy of situations light novel with following premise:
+ most of what is described in the known isekai novels and anime are actually the result the teen goddesses doing their homework on 'Reincarnation management' course;
+ and now it is the time to discuss and grade them by actually adult goddess teacher;

You may use any trope you think are necessary. Be vivid, verbose, detailed, descriptive and expressive. Rearrange, redact and edit text to follow proper storytelling conventions and for logical narrative progression. Do not drag chapters unnecessary. Edit out repetitive parts.
